    "file_name": "XIN_ENG_20061119.0067.tml",
    "doc_text": "XIN_ENG_20061119.0067\n\nTOKYO, Nov. 19 , 2006 (Xinhua)\n\nJapan beat Australia 1-0 in Asian Games warm-up\n\n\n\n\nShinobu Ono scored the only goal to give Japan women's team a 1-0 win over Australia on Sunday in a warm-up soccer match for the Asian Games next month in Doha.\n\nThe decisive goal came in the 51st minute when Yuki Nagasato sent a cross into the area, which Ono fired in with a right-footed shot.\n\nThe Japanese women missed good chances afterwards, but they showed tight defence to fend off the Australian attacks.\n\nJapan will play Germany in another warm-up game next Thursday before heading to the Asian Games a week later.",
